<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Car Transport from Bangalore to Chandigarh | Express Enclosed Carrier
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How much does car transport from Bangalore to Chandigarh typically cost?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The cost varies based on vehicle size, weight, and any additional services such as full‑coverage insurance or door‑to‑door delivery. For a standard sedan, prices generally range between INR 12,000 and ₹18,000, while larger SUVs or luxury cars may attract higher rates. Our transparent quote breaks down each component, ensuring no hidden fees.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the usual transit time for a vehicle shipped between Bangalore and Chandigarh?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Using our dedicated multi‑axle express freight highways, the average transit time is 4 to 5 business days, covering roughly 2,570 km. Factors such as weather, road conditions, and mandatory rest stops can influence the schedule, but we provide real‑time GPS tracking so you can monitor progress at every checkpoint.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are my car’s accessories and personal belongings covered during the move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. All items inside the vehicle are protected by our 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging and the enclosed carrier’s climate‑controlled environment. Additionally, the 100 % declared‑value IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance covers any loss or damage to both the vehicle and its contents, giving you complete peace of mind.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for RTO registration after the car arrives in Chandigarh?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need the original registration certificate, a copy of the insurance policy, a valid pollution under‑control (PUC) certificate, the e‑Way bill generated during transit, and a signed delivery receipt. Our team also assists with the Form 20 transfer and provides a notarised hand‑over report to simplify the local RTO process.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the hydraulic ramp loading process protect my vehicle from scratches?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The hydraulic ramp gently lowers the car onto the carrier’s low‑profile deck, eliminating the need for manual winching. Combined with 4‑wheel lock clamps and edge‑padding foam, the vehicle is secured without any contact to the paintwork. This method guarantees a zero‑scratch guarantee throughout the entire journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my car in real time during the Bangalore‑Chandigarh journey?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Absolutely. Each of our 120+ specialized trucks is equipped with satellite GPS that feeds live location data to our customer portal. You receive instant updates via SMS or email, and you can also view the route map on our website, ensuring full visibility from pick‑up to delivery.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is insurance mandatory for the car transport, and what does the IRDAI‑approved coverage include?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">While optional, we strongly recommend the IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance for complete protection. The policy covers total loss, accidental damage, theft, and natural calamities up to the declared value of the vehicle. It also extends to any accessories, ensuring that both the car and its contents are financially safeguarded.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
